menu "OTA API Configuration"

    config OTA_API_TASK_STACK_SIZE
        int "OTA task stack size (bytes)"
        default 8192
        help
            Stack size of the background task created by ota_api_start_task().
            Used when ota_api_config_t.task_stack_size is 0.

    config OTA_API_TASK_PRIORITY
        int "OTA task priority"
        range 1 24
        default 5
        help
            FreeRTOS priority of the background task created by
            ota_api_start_task(). Used when ota_api_config_t.task_priority is 0.

    config OTA_API_TRIAL_TIMEOUT_S
        int "Trial window before automatic rollback (seconds)"
        range 10 3600
        default 120
        help
            How long ota_api_trial_begin() waits for ota_api_trial_confirm()
            before rolling back to the previous firmware. Used when its
            timeout_s argument is 0.

            This is what keeps an unattended device from being stranded on a
            broken update: long enough for whatever confirms the image to
            react, short enough that a field device recovers on its own.

endmenu
